RRD42 info:
From the back, jumper block is on left:

	P 0 1 2

	P in for RRD42, out for SONY xxx
		(controls block size and ID)

        SCSI ID bits  (note order)
           ID    0    1    2
           0    Out  Out  Out
           1     In  Out  Out
           2    Out   In  Out
