The VRC16-CA and -HA are essentially the same monitor, however the -CA
has a maximum refresh rate of 66Hz at 1280x1024.  The -HA (a later
version with low-EMI, etc) was "bumped" to 1280x1024 @ 72Hz (or maybe
76, I can't remember)

As for the cable, the DEC part is BC13L-10 (10-foot)   Make sure you
have the three colors (RGB) AND the horizontal and vertical sync cables
(on the DEC cable, they're white and black)  


