I can't help with full documentation, but getting the TLZ06 to
change tapes to the "next" one is easy.  After you finish writing
the tape in the drive, do the equivalent of:

mt unload
or
mt rewoffl

It should unload the current tape and load the next one in the stack.
There are ioctl commands to do the same thing, if you're writing a
program.

