enough memory after that. And I don't speak about the conception of
STARTNET.BAT and the "windows" product of PWRK 5.0. I can understand that a
developer who as already work on a PC can build so bad software, with so much
module, and with so many different configuration possibilities. Digital people
must looking on the Novell direction! IPX, NETX and you are connect to the
network. all the rest is on the server ! In my mind, this is the simplest way
to do !!!

