100% stupid - I'm more likely to get injured (or create an unsafe repair) 
if I _don't_ have the manual

But, most consumer electronics manuals are available if you hunt for 
them. This is getting off-topic, so I'll stop now.


I notice you're in the same building as me. You're welcome to come and 
