reloaded all the Xircom config info, drivers, etc., at least to get back to
where I was on the old machine.  Apparently, there is a problem with the
DEC Redirector software--the scheduler thinks the redirector is already 
loaded, but it isn't, and when the redirector goes to load, the system 
indicates that an "incorrect version" has been loaded.

