phdewi@swcp.com (Phillip Williams) wrote:
>I have some 8 bit DECPA boards and was wondering if anybody knows
>what jumpers change the IRQ.

According to my manual:

The switches 8 thru 12 on the DIP switch pack control the IRQ:

SW8     IRQ5     default
SW9     IRQ9
SW10    IRQ10
SW11    IRQ11
SW12    IRQ12

Set the one you want ON and all the rest OFF.




